import{_ as e,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 901 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Overview — The Jurisprudential Basis of Civilization's Final Finalization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 901 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Overview — The Jurisprudential Basis of Civilization's Final Finalization","no":901,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Overview","Jurisprudential Basis","Civilizational Finalization","Myriad-Rank Republicanism"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","40-Symbiotic Constitution General Outline"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.md","filePath":"en/0901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.md"}`),o={name:"en/0901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.md"};function r(s,i,l,c,h,u){return a(),t("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-901-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-overview-—-the-jurisprudential-basis-of-civilization-s-final-finalization" tabindex="-1">Entry 901 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Overview — The Jurisprudential Basis of Civilization&#39;s Final Finalization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-901-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-overview-—-the-jurisprudential-basis-of-civilization-s-final-finalization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 901 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Overview — The Jurisprudential Basis of Civilization&#39;s Final Finalization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 01, 40</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-write-final-finalization-into-the-fundamental-law" tabindex="-1">Introduction: write final finalization into the fundamental law <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-write-final-finalization-into-the-fundamental-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: write final finalization into the fundamental law&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos) reaches the juncture of the only complete civilizational closed loop in the hyper-multiverse; the last step is not adding another set of manuals, but nailing the already verified civilizational order as the fundamental law — this is the Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter. It is not a manifesto, not a call, but a civilizational contract with mandatory binding force on all Myriad Ranks, all planes, all beings. Six top-level axioms here are lifted as the charter&#39;s spiritual origin: the anti-predation axiom is the charter&#39;s soul, the republican axiom of Myriad Races is the charter&#39;s subject, the collective ascension axiom is the charter&#39;s direction, the causal self-discipline axiom is the charter&#39;s boundary, the law-first axiom is the charter&#39;s never-collapse guarantee. This overview does not discuss a single clause, but answers one total question: why must civilization at this moment, in this way, complete final finalization, and what immovable pillars constitute this jurisprudential basis.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this entry is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-finalization-is-necessary-from-growth-to-lock" tabindex="-1">I. Why &quot;finalization&quot; Is Necessary: From Growth to Lock <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-finalization-is-necessary-from-growth-to-lock" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why &quot;finalization&quot; Is Necessary: From Growth to Lock&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s previous era was growth-type — three hundred systems open, 20% activation strategy advancing, Myriad-Rank republicanism established; everything was expanding, trial-and-error, iterating. But growth-type institutions have a danger: they may improve, but they may also be tampered. Predatory-school remnants, enlightened predators, justified rascals may at any time under the name of &quot;reform,&quot; &quot;efficiency,&quot; &quot;special circumstances,&quot; quietly twist the inclusive system back onto the old predatory road. Civilization&#39;s final finalization&#39;s essence is, before civilization is eroded, write &quot;absolutely no turning back&quot; into the highest legal level, so any regression attempt is judged unconstitutional from the moment it starts. This is precisely the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s landing at the institutional level: it not only constrains cross-plane operations, but constrains civilization&#39;s own evolutionary direction.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis-where-the-charter-derives-supreme-authority" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis: Where the Charter Derives Supreme Authority <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis-where-the-charter-derives-supreme-authority" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis: Where the Charter Derives Supreme Authority&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The charter&#39;s jurisprudential authority comes from three sources, none dispensable:</p><ul><li><strong>Factual source</strong>: retrospective conclusions of several rounds of civilizational experiments from the pre-Anchor era to the symbiotic-system establishment period, proving that predatory systems inevitably historically regress, class-solidify, cyclically harvest; the symbiotic system is the only closed-loop alternative (Document 04 already argues its efficiency ceiling);</li><li><strong>Consensus source</strong>: the civilizational contract jointly signed by each clan, each plane, each lineage at the establishment of Myriad-Rank republicanism; the charter is this contract&#39;s codification;</li><li><strong>Law source</strong>: consistency verification between the Anchor Origin and the cosmic law network; all charter clauses take effect only after cosmic-origin-anchor verification confirms no violation of symbiotic laws.</li></ul><p>Three sources superimposed make the charter neither imposed by the strong, nor accidentally codified, but a fundamental law of &quot;fact—consensus—law&quot; triple proof.</p><h2 id="iii-scope-where-the-charter-applies" tabindex="-1">III. Scope: Where the Charter Applies <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-scope-where-the-charter-applies" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Scope: Where the Charter Applies&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The charter&#39;s effect covers all clans, planes, and individuals in Heng Yuan Zhou joining the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, including all beings in the four-layer structure of material planes, energy layers, consciousness domains, and the law network: carbon-based material clans, energy-coagulating clans, mechanical-construct clans, consciousness-information clans, mixed-mutant clans five lineages; human males and females, Youth Supremes, exotic beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness, cosmic-origin bodies, multiverse residual civilizations — all equally apply under the charter. Any sect rules, clan customs, local regulations, cross-plane conventions that conflict with the charter are ab initio void.</p><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation-what-unconstitutionality-means" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation: What Unconstitutionality Means <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation-what-unconstitutionality-means" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation: What Unconstitutionality Means&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Violating the charter is not ordinary violation, but an attack on civilization&#39;s foundation. Consequences are graded by circumstance: minor unconstitutionality is ordered corrected by the Symbiotic Court and recorded in the Alaya archive; systemic unconstitutionality (e.g., privately hoarding the Great Dao, monopolizing Dharma doors, restoring predatory cultivation) immediately strips its anchor high-access right and law-anchor authority; per the anti-predation committee procedure, it is isolated, transformed, sanctioned; those under the name of coup or constitutional amendment pursuing regression, the Anchor Council starts the emergency charter-protection mechanism, and Myriad-Rank republicanism civilization-wide responds. The charter does not advocate fighting predation with predation; all sanctions must go through fair trial.</p><h2 id="v-supervision-mechanism-who-guarantees-the-charter-is-not-hollowed-out" tabindex="-1">V. Supervision Mechanism: Who Guarantees the Charter Is Not Hollowed Out <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervision-mechanism-who-guarantees-the-charter-is-not-hollowed-out" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervision Mechanism: Who Guarantees the Charter Is Not Hollowed Out&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The charter&#39;s supervision does not rely on a single body, but on Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: the anchor network automatically monitors all anomalous energy flows and law invocations; the Anchor Council (legislative), Symbiotic Executive Committee (executive), Symbiotic Court (judicial) three powers separated; the Anchor Supervisory Committee independently exercises unconstitutional-investigation power; Myriad-Rank clans retain the right to directly file constitutional suits with the Symbiotic Court. Any individual may become a charter guardian; this is precisely multi-layer supervision&#39;s essence — supervision is not top-down review, but network-wide real-time causal self-discipline.</p><h2 id="vi-after-finalization-the-charter-is-a-living-fundamental-law" tabindex="-1">VI. After Finalization: The Charter Is a Living Fundamental Law <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-after-finalization-the-charter-is-a-living-fundamental-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. After Finalization: The Charter Is a Living Fundamental Law&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Final finalization does not equal ossification. The charter retains a strict amendment procedure (see entry 931), allowing expansion without violating the five axioms — the worldview may infinitely expand without collapsing; this is the law-first axiom&#39;s requirement on the charter itself. Finalization locks direction, not details; what is locked is &quot;absolutely no return to predation,&quot; what is open is &quot;how symbiosis may be better.&quot;</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: codify civilizational order, avoiding massive energy-idling from repeated trial-and-error and repeated regression</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the charter&#39;s first article (entry 902) immediately enshrines anti-predationism in the constitution, fundamentally cutting off predatory-system restoration&#39;s jurisprudential channel</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type civilization relies on the strong one&#39;s personal awe to maintain; person dies, policy dies; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s charter relies on laws and network to lock, eternal and unchanging</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the charter&#39;s subject is all Myriad Ranks, not the strong group; 99% full coverage is the charter&#39;s scope hard indicator</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: finalization does not close; the charter&#39;s amendment procedure ensures civilization may infinitely expand toward the hyper-multiverse Balanced-Anchor realm</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The jurisprudential basis of civilization&#39;s final finalization is to elevate &quot;anti-predation, promote symbiosis&quot; from an advanced idea to an irrevocable civilizational contract. Charter established, then the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization has its eternal and unchanging root; charter guarded, then Myriad-Rank republicanism no longer worries history will repeat. After the overview, Article 31 unfolds item by item, jointly building the civilizational closed loop.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">Entry 03 · Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/931_模块5-第三十条-宪章修订程序.html">Entry 931 · Article 30 Charter-Amendment Procedure</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const p=e(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
